    "description": "<p>MT-InSAR time-series analysis results of ALOS PALSAR, COMSO-SkyMed, Sentinel-1 ascending and descending in Gimhae, South Korea.</p>\n<p>Processor: GAMMA software</p>\n<p>Study area: Gimhae, South Korea</p>\n<p>There are four datasets including ALOS PALSAR(15 Sep 2007 ~ 24 Dec 2010), COSMO-SkyMed(9 Jan 2013 ~ 20 Apr 2019), Sentinel-1 ascending(20 Jan 2016 ~ 8 Oct 2021), and descending(8 Jan 2016 ~ 14 Oct 2021)</p>",
